      "id": "1-architectural-overview-design-philosophy",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. Architectural Overview & Design Philosophy"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Retiam provides a unified, hardware-accelerated mathematical graphing and coordinate visualization engine designed for motion graphics, mathematical explanations (3Blue1Brown/Manim style), and scientific animations."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The architecture connects mathematical spaces ($\\mathbb{R}^2$, $\\mathbb{R}^3$, $\\mathbb{C}$, and polar coordinates $(r, \\theta)$) to Retiam's WebGPU rendering pipelines through a universal coordinate mapping contract and a single source of truth parameter system."
        },
        {
          "type": "tree",
          "variant": "horizontal",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "label": "Entity",
              "description": "Shared configuration: `EntityOptions`.",
              "children": [
                {
                  "label": "VectorEntity",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "label": "CoordinateSystem",
                      "description": "Coordinate mapping with c2p, p2c and fluent helpers.",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "label": "Axes"
                        },
                        {
                          "label": "NumberPlane",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "label": "ComplexPlane"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "label": "PolarAxes"
                        },
                        {
                          "label": "ThreeDAxes"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2-core-coordinates-contract-coordinatesystem",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. Core Coordinates Contract (CoordinateSystem)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Every coordinate system in Retiam extends [`CoordinateSystem`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/composites/coordinates/CoordinateSystem.ts), which implements coordinate mapping and exposes fluent plotting and calculus methods:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "Fundamental Coordinate Mapping API"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Method",
            "Signature",
            "Description"
          ],
          "rows": [
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`c2p`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "`(...coords: number[]) => Vec3`"
                },
                {
                  "text": "**Coordinates to Point**: Converts mathematical coordinates (e.g. $(x, y)$ or $(x, y, z)$ or $(r, \\theta)$) into world-space scene vectors."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`p2c`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "`(point: Vec3) => number[]`"
                },
                {
                  "text": "**Point to Coordinates**: Inverts world-space scene coordinates back into the underlying mathematical domain."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`getOrigin`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "`() => Vec3`"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Returns the world-space position of the origin $(0, 0, 0)$."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3-coordinate-systems-hierarchy",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Coordinate Systems Hierarchy"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "A. [Axes](../src/engine/entities/composites/coordinates/Axes.ts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**Domain:** 2D Cartesian plane $(\\mathbb{R}^2)$.",
            {
              "text": "**Features:**",
              "children": [
                "Auto-scaling dynamic multi-scale grid lines (major and minor subdivisions).",
                "Scale-independent arrowhead sizing that scales with line width.",
                "Configurable domains `xRange: [min, max, step]`, `yRange: [min, max, step]`.",
                "Fully reactive to size/range mutations via `rangeVersion`."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "const axes = new Axes({\n    xRange: [-6, 6, 1],\n    yRange: [-4, 4, 1],\n    width: 14,\n    height: 9,\n    axisColor: new Color(0.7, 0.7, 0.8, 1.0),\n    gridColor: new Color(0.25, 0.25, 0.35, 0.3),\n    showGrid: true\n});\nscene.add(axes);"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "B. [NumberPlane](../src/engine/entities/composites/coordinates/NumberPlane.ts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**Domain:** Dense 2D Cartesian grid $(\\mathbb{R}^2)$ designed for spatial deformations.",
            {
              "text": "**Features:**",
              "children": [
                "Subdivided line geometry (`subdivisions: 50`) optimized for real-time non-linear deformations via `applyFunction` and `applyHomotopy`.",
                "Origin coordinate tracking and tick marks."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "const plane = new NumberPlane({\n    xRange: [-8, 8, 1],\n    yRange: [-5, 5, 1],\n    width: 18,\n    height: 11,\n    subdivisions: 40\n});"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "C. [ComplexPlane](../src/engine/entities/composites/coordinates/ComplexPlane.ts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**Domain:** Complex Analysis plane ($\\mathbb{C}$, Argand diagram) with Real axis ($x$) and Imaginary axis ($y$).",
            {
              "text": "**Features:**",
              "children": [
                "Complex coordinate mapping: `n2p(z: ComplexLike)` (Number to Point) and `p2n(p: Vec3)` (Point to Number).",
                "Direct complex parametric curve plotting: `plotComplexCurve(t => Complex, tRange, options)`.",
                "1:1 synchronization with `Field.conformal(fn)` and `HomotopyAnimation`."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "const cPlane = new ComplexPlane({\n    realRange: [-5, 5, 1],\n    imagRange: [-3, 3, 1],\n    width: 14,\n    height: 8.4\n});\n\n// Plot epicycle: gamma(t) = 1.6 e^{i t} + 0.5 e^{i 3t}\nconst epicycle = cPlane.plotComplexCurve(\n    (t) => Complex.polar(1.6, t).add(Complex.polar(0.5, 3 * t)),\n    [0, 2 * Math.PI],\n    { stroke: Color.MAGENTA, stroke_width: 0.06 }\n);"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "D. [PolarAxes](../src/engine/entities/composites/coordinates/PolarAxes.ts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**Domain:** Polar coordinates $(r, \\theta)$ with radial radius $r \\in [0, r_{\\max}]$ and angle $\\theta \\in [0, 2\\pi)$.",
            {
              "text": "**Features:**",
              "children": [
                "Concentric major and minor circular rings with faded subdivision strokes.",
                "Radial angle rays with automatic quadrant-centered degree labels (`0°`, `30°`, `60°`, ...).",
                "Direct polar curve plotting: `plotPolar(rFn, options)`."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "const polarAxes = new PolarAxes({\n    radius: 5.5,\n    rMax: 4,\n    rStep: 1,\n    thetaStep: Math.PI / 6,\n    showGrid: true,\n    showLabels: true\n});\n\n// Rose curve: r(theta) = 3.5 cos(4 theta)\nconst rose = polarAxes.plotPolar((theta) => 3.5 * Math.cos(4 * theta), {\n    stroke: Color.fromHex(\"#FF5588\"),\n    stroke_width: 0.06\n});"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "E. [ThreeDAxes](../src/engine/entities/composites/coordinates/ThreeDAxes.ts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**Domain:** 3D Cartesian volume $(\\mathbb{R}^3)$ with $(x, y, z)$ axes.",
            {
              "text": "**Features:**",
              "children": [
                "3D grid planes on `xy`, `xz`, and `yz` cross-sections.",
                "Cone arrowheads on X, Y, and Z axes.",
                "Camera-facing SDF text labels for tick values and axis names.",
                "3D parametric plotting via `axes3D.plotParametricCurve3D(fx, fy, fz, options)`."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "typescript",
          "code": "const axes3D = new ThreeDAxes({\n    xRange: [-5, 5, 2],\n    yRange: [-5, 5, 2],\n    zRange: [-3, 3, 1],\n    width: 10,\n    depth: 10,\n    height: 6,\n    showGrid: true,\n    gridPlanes: [\"xy\", \"xz\", \"yz\"]\n});\n\nconst helix = axes3D.plotParametricCurve3D(\n    (t) => 2.5 * Math.cos(t),\n    (t) => 2.5 * Math.sin(t),\n    (t) => 0.25 * t - 2.0,\n    { tRange: [0, 5 * Math.PI], stroke: Color.CYAN }\n);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4-plotting-calculus-visualizers-calculus-ts",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. Plotting & Calculus Visualizers (Calculus.ts)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Every `CoordinateSystem` instance provides high-level calculus visualizers that output renderable vector entities:"
        },
        {
          "type": "tree",
          "variant": "horizontal",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "label": "Calculus helpers",
              "description": "CoordinateSystem methods.",
              "children": [
                {
                  "label": "CoordinateSystem.getArea"
                },
                {
                  "label": "CoordinateSystem.getRiemannRectangles"
                },
                {
                  "label": "CoordinateSystem.getTangentLine"
                },
                {
                  "label": "CoordinateSystem.getLinesToPoint"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 4,
          "text": "Methods Summary"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Fluent Method",
            "Returns",
            "Description"
          ],
          "rows": [
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.plot(fn, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`FunctionGraph2D`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/composites/plotting/FunctionGraph2D.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Plots an explicit function $y = f(x)$ with zero-allocation GPU buffer streaming."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getArea(curve, [a, b], options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`Poly`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/primitives/2d/Poly.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Creates a shaded definite integral polygon $\\int_a^b (f(x) - g(x))\\,dx$."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getRiemannRectangles(curve, [a, b], dx, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`VGroup`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/layout/VGroup.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Creates approximation bars using `midpoint`, `trapezoid`, `left`, or `right` rules."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getTangentLine(x0, curve, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`Line3D`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/primitives/3d/Line3D.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Computes numerical derivative $f'(x_0)$ and returns a tangent line segment."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getSecantSlopeGroup(x0, dx, curve, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`VGroup`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/layout/VGroup.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Returns a triangle group containing secant line, horizontal $\\Delta x$ bar, and vertical $\\Delta y$ bar."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getLinesToPoint(point, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`VGroup`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/layout/VGroup.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Drops dashed horizontal and vertical projection lines to the coordinate axes."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getDot(coords, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`Dot`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/primitives/2d/Dot.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Places a styled `Dot` at mathematical coordinates."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "`plane.getLabeledDot(label, coords, options)`",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "[`LabeledDot`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/primitives/2d/Dot.ts)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Places a `LabeledDot` with text centered on the coordinate point."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5-strict-zero-alias-parameter-architecture",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "5. Strict Zero-Alias Parameter Architecture"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "All options across the entire coordinate and plotting subsystems inherit from [`EntityOptions`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/_core/Entity.ts#L29) or [`ModelOptions`](https://github.com/abhilasbiswas/Retiam/blob/main/src/engine/entities/primitives/3d/Model.ts#L17). There are **zero duplicate aliases** or ambiguous parameter keys:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "**Primary Body Color:** Strictly `fill?: Color`",
            "**Outline / Line Color:** Strictly `stroke?: Color`",
            "**Line Width:** Strictly `stroke_width?: number`",
            "**Spatial Position:** Strictly `position?: Vec3Type`",
            "**Transparency:** Strictly `opacity?: number`"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
